Add full lists of ALL added and removed blocks and ALL added and removed items to the infographic so a mapping group can see every change without opening the CLI. This will make the infographic long, which is acceptable (no required aspect ratio); make each table compact (smaller font, tight row height, possibly multi-column) to compensate. Columns at minimum: +/-, block/item name (elide long item paths), position (free-look blocks only; use '--' for normal/ghost blocks per B059 convention). These lists sit below the grouped per-name summaries (B073).